       "occ": 1,
       "new": "Founded as Tecon Pacific in 1963, Clark Pacific began in West Sacramento on a four-acre site with fifteen employees and James Clark as its general manager. With the support of dedicated engineering, manufacturing facilities, and field teams, the company grew rapidly during the early years of the industry in California. As new methods emerged for forming, casting, finishing, shipping, and on-site installation, Clark Pacific built those capabilities into a disciplined, repeatable delivery model used across diverse project types on the West Coast."
